<title>THAILAND: Thai chemical plant blast kills four.</title>
<headline>Thai chemical plant blast kills four.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>A huge explosion at a chemical plant on the outskirts of Bangkok killed four people on Tuesday and injured 26, police said.</p>
<p>The blast happened in the early afternoon at the Bangphoo Chemical Co in Samut Prakarn province, about 50 km (30 miles) east of the capital, a police official said.</p>
<p>&quot;It was such a huge blast that two buildings linked to the plant were torn down and its impact overturned a car moving in front of the plant,&quot; he told Reuters.</p>
<p>Police said they were investigating.</p>
</text>
